    "limitations": [
      "This is a small source-selected liquid-equity event sample, with repeated issuers and correlated events. Numeric comparisons do not establish broad predictive accuracy.",
      "Current-vintage adjusted prices lack historical as-of vintages. Adjusted closes are not literal executable fills; the delayed-close policy is hypothetical.",
